    {
      "id": "msg_0538_T11R0702_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} entered the motor.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} is trying to\n",
        "learn {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\r",
        "But {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} can’t learn\n",
        "more than four moves.\r",
        "Delete a move to make\n",
        "room for {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0538_T11R0702_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Give up on learning the move\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0538_T11R0702_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} did not learn\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} emerged from the motor."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0538_T11R0702_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "The move {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0} will be\n",
        "forgotten. Is that OK? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0538_T11R0702_00004",
      "en_US": "1,{PAUSE 20} 2,{PAUSE 20} and...{PAUSE 20} ...{PAUSE 20} Poof!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0538_T11R0702_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} forgot how to\n",
        "use {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\r",
        "And..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0538_T11R0702_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} learned\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0538_T11R0702_00007",
      "en_US": "Which ROTOM are you choosing?\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0538_T11R0702_00008",
      "en_US": "An Egg can’t enter a motor."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0538_T11R0702_00009",
      "en_US": "That Pokémon can’t enter a motor."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0538_T11R0702_00010",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} entered the motor.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0538_T11R0702_00011",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} emerged from the motor.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0538_T11R0702_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Return which ROTOM to its\n",
        "original form? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0538_T11R0702_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh? ROTOM appears as if it wants to\n",
        "revert to its original form.\r",
        "Would you like to recall it from\n",
        "the motor? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0538_T11R0702_00014",
      "en_US": "RECALL"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0538_T11R0702_00015",
      "en_US": "YES"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0538_T11R0702_00016",
      "en_US": "NO"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0538_T11R0702_00017",
      "en_US": "That ROTOM hasn’t entered a motor."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0538_T11R0702_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "There was an appliance here.\n",
        "The one with the oddly shaped motor."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0538_T11R0702_00019",
      "en_US": "CANCEL"
    },
    {
